      "revision": 1357413855,
      "text": "Lippia micromera, commonly referred to as stick oregano or false oregano, is a plant species. It is used in regional cuisines including Puerto Rican cuisine and Dominican cuisine. It has white flowers."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Lippia micromera",
